  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDEA - AU Joint Activity Plan (JAP) 2016-2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Purpose: To implement AUC mandate related to the AU &quot;Charter on Democracy, Elections and Governance&quot; as well as the AUs Shared Values agenda.

Expected Result: Domestication of the AU Charter on Democracy, Elections and Governance in Member States.</narrative>
  </description>
